rmpd (0.5.0+native4) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Add rmpd-macros regression and integration test coverage for
    CommandMetadata derive behavior:
    - integration test for unit, named-field, and tuple variants,
      including default permission handling
    - compile-fail trybuild UI cases for invalid parameters and input,
      including non-enum derive target, missing command name,
      unknown attribute key, wrong literal types, and out-of-range
      permission values
  * Validate changes with `cargo test -p rmpd-macros`.

 -- ibiscum <ibiscum@users.noreply.github.com>  Sat, 04 Jul 2026 01:51:13 +0200

rmpd (0.5.0+native3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add rmpd-library regression/integration tests for invalid parameters and
    edge cases in compatibility suite:
    - metadata errors for missing files and supported-extension boundaries
    - CUE parser malformed track/index handling and INDEX00 fallback behavior
    - database invalid path/playlist parameter errors and post-error
      operational sanity checks
  * Validate changes with `cargo test -p rmpd-library`.

 -- ibiscum <ibiscum@users.noreply.github.com>  Sat, 04 Jul 2026 01:44:18 +0200

rmpd (0.5.0+native2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add rmpd-core invalid-input regression and integration coverage for:
    - filter parser edge cases (empty input, dangling operators,
      unterminated/unquoted values, and unbalanced parenthesis)
    - config loading/validation failures (missing file, malformed TOML,
      and nonexistent music_directory)
    - storage backend invalid parameters (invalid URI format,
      unsupported protocol, and non-UTF-8 mountpoint handling on Unix)
  * Validate changes with `cargo test -p rmpd-core --features test-utils`.

 -- ibiscum <ibiscum@users.noreply.github.com>  Sat, 04 Jul 2026 01:38:52 +0200

rmpd (0.5.0+native1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add Debian packaging scaffold for building a binary package with
    `dpkg-buildpackage`/`sbuild`.
  * Add debhelper metadata, systemd service integration, maintainer scripts,
    and a system-wide `/etc/rmpd/rmpd.toml` sample configuration.
  * Add a root `build.sh` wrapper modeled on `ibiscum/acr` for `sbuild`
    builds.

 -- ibiscum <ibiscum@users.noreply.github.com>  Sat, 04 Jul 2026 00:43:07 +0200

rmpd (0.5.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Pin rusqlite to 0.39.0 so cargo no longer resolves to 0.40.x,
    which currently fails to build on stable Rust because of upstream
    cfg_select! usage.
  * Add TCP-level parser regression coverage for quoted libmpdclient-style
    commands, malformed quoted input, unknown protocol subcommands, and
    command-list parse failures.
  * Fix command-list handling so raw batch entries are buffered until
    command_list_end, preserving earlier list_OK markers and reporting the
    correct failing command index for parse errors.

 -- ibiscum <ibiscum@users.noreply.github.com>  Sat, 04 Jul 2026 00:08:52 +0200
